    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im not talking about a phone call... i mean everything. i look around and there is nothing left. no cities, no people, just dust and this ache. what is the point of fighting for one more hour of pain when the world is already dead? it just feels like i'm prolonging the inevitable.",
